# Varnish VCL: Varnish Cache documentation: VCL syntax; requirements/languages/vcl.md
name     vcl varnish
keyword  vcl backend sub if else elsif elseif set unset return call synthetic import include acl new
keyword  probe
builtin  req resp bereq beresp obj client server std hash pass pipe lookup deliver fetch purge true false
ident-part     .-
line-comment   # //
block-comment  /* */
string   {" "}  : multiline
string   " "
operators  =~!&|<>+-*/{}();,
